 * /new design system — quiet golf, LIGHT. Optimized for reading in bright
 * sunlight: a soft off-white background (bright but glare-reduced vs pure white)
 * with high-contrast dark-green ink. The org's --brand tints accents (monogram,
 * section labels, active states) while the bright base stays constant across
 * tenants. Libre Franklin everywhere for readability; Playfair Display serif is
 * reserved for the single event title. Minimal ornament.
